-- The Ofek Hadash agreements' root (MMS-548): the agreements of the Ofek
-- Hadash reform that speak to an item of the shared vocabulary
-- (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), each registered once as an instrument (it
-- describes itself in its own file), and what each claims for a case. The
-- agreements' root (l4/lib/agreements-root.l4) imports it beside the other
-- families' roots; precedence is left to l4/lib/precedence.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT terms
IMPORT `2017-03-19_ofek-hadash_march-2017-amendment`
IMPORT `2022-10-19_ofek-hadash_wage-agreement`

§ `שורש הסכמי אופק חדש — מה ההסכמים של הרפורמה אומרים על כל פריט`

§§ `המסמכים`

-- This root includes the Ofek Hadash agreements:
`the Ofek Hadash agreements' instruments` MEANS
    LIST `the agreement of 19.3.2017`, `the agreement of 19.10.2022`

§§ `מה ההסכמים אומרים, לפי פריט`

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the Ofek Hadash agreements' claims on` i c IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the agreement of 19.3.2017` (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to the agreement of 19.3.2017` c),
                        `the claim of` `the agreement of 19.10.2022` (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to the agreement of 19.10.2022` c))
    WHEN `the mentor's allowance rate` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the agreement of 19.3.2017` (`the mentor's rate according to the agreement of 19.3.2017` c))
    WHEN `the junior-division head's allowance` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `the agreement of 19.10.2022` (`the junior-division head's allowance according to the agreement of 19.10.2022` c))
    OTHERWISE EMPTY

-- What the site's page of this root lists (tools/roots.py): each instrument
-- it includes, its module and its name.
#EVAL map (GIVEN i YIELD CONCAT i's `module`, " | ", i's `title`) `the Ofek Hadash agreements' instruments`
